&lt;li&gt;Support technical documentation and troubleshooting efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to research, analysis, and implementation of new tools or methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team meetings and provide input on technical challenges and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
