&lt;p&gt;The role underwrites Coalition’s Cyber and Technology PI solutions and serves as a trusted resource to brokers and customers. This includes assessing and pricing risk, developing market opportunities, and educating partners on practical ways to strengthen cyber protection. The position is remote within the UK, with regular travel for broker, client, and internal engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a hybrid opportunity with the expectation that this person will be able to work out of the London office (2-3 days a week) for business purposes and broker engagement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
