&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Product to execute territory strategies and achieve production and profitability targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply knowledge of the UK cyber insurance market to identify opportunities and capture profitable market share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate brokers and customers on cyber exposures, coverage solutions, and risk improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage broker relationships, placement timelines, policy workflows, and stakeholder commitments with consistent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
