&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career: apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CFO Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is Northern Europe’s largest CFO forum and aims to connect and develop CFOs, finance leaders, and tomorrow&#39;s innovators by addressing the issues of the future CFO. We are connecting more than 11,000 professionals from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited growth potential. &lt;/strong&gt;You will get responsibility before you feel ready. That is how you grow fast. We strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally. You can expect coaching and development from leaders, peers and experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that compound for life.&lt;/strong&gt; Fast execution, copywriting, pricing, conversion optimisation, structured problem solving, and the ability to create impact anywhere in the business at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from the very start.&lt;/strong&gt; You own outcomes, not tasks. We agree the goal, and you find the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be joining our 10+ conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities in this job will vary, however, feed into the mission: build the world&

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the company that’s building the telemetry infrastructure for the AI era. At Cribl, we partner with IT and Security teams at many of the world’s biggest enterprises, including half of the Fortune 100, to bridge the gap between AI ambition and infrastructure reality. As the AI Platform for Telemetry, we give customers the choice, control, and flexibility to manage and analyze telemetry for both humans and agents, so they can build what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re one of the fastest‑growing private companies and a leading player in a massive, fast‑moving market. With a global workforce, we’re remote‑first and grounded in a simple idea: software is a people business. Cribl is the place where curious, collaborative people can do their best work, grow fast, and bring their full selves to the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Location: UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help CIOs, CISOs, and CTOs see how Cribl can turn complex telemetry, observability, and security challenges into measurable business value whilst earning the confidence of an enterprise architect through your technical depth and consultative approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner directly with Account Executives throughout complex sales cycles, from discovery and solution design through proof of value and close. You’ll design and configure solutions by working with real customer data and demonstrating how Cribl can help customers improve operational and security outcomes. Your work will span the AI Platform for Telemetry, helping customers build a flexible data foundation for observability, security, and AI-driven operations rather than limiting them to a single tool or use case.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives to own technical strategy from discovery through proof of value to close, defining use cases and measurable success criteria across observability, security, and IT operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored demos, whiteboards, workshops and executive presentations that connect business value to technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proof of value, from configuration to validating and presenting results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address objections, differentiate Cribl and secure the technical win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Customer Success, Services, Support and partners for a smooth implementation handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with Product and Engineering to improve solutions and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If You’ve Got It - We Want It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt

